---
// About — condensed founder bio
---
<section class="section about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="container about__inner">

    <div class="about__mark" aria-hidden="true" data-reveal>
      <img src="/logo-lantern-large.png" alt="" class="about__logo" width="220" height="220" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
    </div>

    <div class="about__copy">
      <span class="section-eyebrow" data-reveal>About</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" id="about-heading" data-reveal data-delay="1">Hi, I'm Jesse.</h2>

      <div class="about__bio" data-reveal data-delay="2">
        <p>
          Before consulting, I spent over a decade on digital products in state and local
          government: modernizing dispatching at the MBTA, shipping products for the City
          of Boston and Mass.gov, scaling a volunteer civic tech organization from 6 to 4,000+
          members, and building two startups.
        </p>
        <p>
          Now I consult on SEO and AI search, process improvement, custom software, and the occasional
          project rescue.
        </p>
        <p>
          When I'm not on client work I'm exploring what's possible with LLMs and AI, launching niche
          mobile apps, or doing light construction on my home. (If you want to swap non-tech stories,
          ask me about my time in Turkey, Syria, and Iraq, or the 14-foot wooden play structure I
          designed and built for my kids.)
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about__certs" data-reveal data-delay="3">
        <span>Lean Six Sigma Green Belt</span>
        <span>Human-Centered Design</span>
        <span>GWU</span>
      </div>

      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jessebiroscak/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="about__linkedin"
        data-reveal
        data-delay="4"
      >
        LinkedIn profile
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2.5 9.5L9.5 2.5M9.5 2.5H4M9.5 2.5V8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
.about {
  background: var(--color-navy);
}

.about__inner {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
  gap: var(--space-16);
  align-items: start;
}

.about__mark {
  position: sticky;
  top: 6rem;
}
.about__logo {
  width: 180px;
  height: 180px;
  object-fit: contain;
  opacity: 0.85;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 32px rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.15));
}

.about__bio {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: var(--space-4);
  margin-top: var(--space-6);
  color: var(--color-white-dim);
  font-size: var(--text-base);
  line-height: 1.75;
  max-width: 66ch;
}

.about__certs {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: var(--space-2);
  margin-top: var(--space-6);
}
.about__certs span {
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  color: var(--color-gold-dim);
  letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
  border: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.2);
  border-radius: 2px;
}

.about__linkedin {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  margin-top: var(--space-6);
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--color-gold);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201, 168, 76, 0.3);
  padding-bottom: 2px;
  transition: color var(--duration-fast), border-color var(--duration-fast);
}
.about__linkedin:hover {
  color: var(--color-gold-light);
  border-color: var(--color-gold);
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about__inner {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }
  .about__mark {
    position: static;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }
  .about__logo { width: 80px; height: 80px; }
}
</style>
